{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":87,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܒܢܲܝ̈ ܩܘܪܚ. ܙܡܪܬ‌ܐ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܫܲܬܐܸܣܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܡܕܝܼܢ݇ܬܹܗ ܒܛܘܼܪ̈ܵܢܹܐ ܕܩܘܼܕܫܵܐ ܝܠܵܗ̇.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܡܲܚܸܒ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܕܲܪ̈ܘܵܙܹܐ ܕܨܸܗܝܘܿܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܘܼܫ ܡ̣ܢ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܡܲܫܟܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܝܲܥܩܘܿܒ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܚܲܒܪܹ̈ܐ ܡܝܘܼܩܪܹ̈ܐ ܗܘܼܡܙܸܡܹܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܒܘܼܬ ܕܝܼܵܟ݂ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܡܕܝܼܢ݇ܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܡܲܕܟܸܪܸܢ ܪܵܚܵܒ݂ ܘܒܵܒܹܠܔ ܓܵܘ ܝܵܕܥܵܢܝܼ̈،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܵܐ، ܦܠܸܫܬ ܘܨܘܿܪ ܥܲܡ ܟܘܼܫ:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܗܵܐ ܦܝܼܫ ܠܹܗ ܝܠܝܼܕܵܐ ܬܵܡܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܒܘܼܬ ܨܸܗܝܘܿܢ ܒܸܬ ܦܵܐܹܫ ܐܡܝܼܪܵܐ:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܐܵܗܵܐ ܘܗ̇ܘ ܦܝܼܫ ܠܹܗ ܝܠܝܼܕܵܐ ܓܵܘܘܼܗ̇.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܗ̇ܘ ܥܸܠܵܝܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܡܲܩܘܹܐ ܠܵܗ̇.“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܡܵܢܹܐ ܐܝܼܡܲܢ ܕܟܵܬܹܒ݂ ܥܲܡܡܹ̈ܐ:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܐܵܗܵܐ ܦܝܼܫ ܠܹܗ ܝܠܝܼܕܵܐ ܬܵܡܵܐ.“ ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܙܲܡܵܪܹ̈ܐ ܥܲܡ ܪ̈ܲܩܵܕܹܐ ܐܵܡܪܝܼ:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܥܲܝܢܵܬ‌ܝܼ̈ ܕܡ̈ܝܼܵܐ ܓܵܘܵܟ݂ܝ ܝܼܢܵܐ.“","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/87.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/88.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/86.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}